  1648	def test_integrity_doc_makes_no_enforced_claim_for_the_tarball_checksum():
  1649	    """The narrower half of P1-3, plus the whole-file sweep that followed it.
  1650	    `SHA256SUMS.txt` is written by a LOCAL `scripts/install-npm.sh` run, is
  1651	    excluded from the package `files:` array, and no workflow materialises a
  1652	    `.tgz` to hash — so the consumer recipe this file used to publish was
